        --><div id="content" class="main-content" data-content-field="main-content" data-collection-id="58f52392e6f2e13a88aade48" data-edit-main-image="">
         <div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type="page" data-updated-on="1783554217962" id="page-58f52392e6f2e13a88aade48"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-12 span-12"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-border-radii="&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-yui_3_17_2_5_1466096836455_7320"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Z SPACE:&nbsp;NOT YOUR AVERAGE<br>REPURPOSED CAN FACTORY</h2><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Z Space is now accepting bookings for 2027. Please contact Curatorial Director Nikki Meñez at&nbsp;</strong><a href="mailto:nmenez@zspace.org"><strong>nmenez@zspace.org</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;to inquire further or fill out our rental request form below.</strong></h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Located in the heart of San Francisco’s vibrant and historic Mission District, Z Space is an unconventional and unique 13,000 square foot venue with the flexibility to suit a variety of event needs. In addition to theater and dance productions, we host community events, staff retreats, holiday parties, ping-pong tournaments, and more.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Originally constructed as a factory for the American Can Company, Z Space has been converted into one of the most dynamic arts centers in San Francisco, featuring a 236-seat flexible performance space (The Steindler Stage), a lobby equipped with a full bar, and a separate downstairs 85-seat intimate theater (Z Below).&nbsp;</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Take a virtual, three-dimension tour of our main stage courtesy of&nbsp;<a href="https://www.google.com/maps?layer=c&amp;z=17&amp;sll=37.763205,-122.41136800000001&amp;cid=-3757108154409216301&amp;panoid=9_rIanHUMobfAZmlzB6ZHQ&amp;cbp=13,301.6071883498964,,0,0&amp;q=z+space&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=-qdIUbHGJsX1iQKnooDQBg&amp;ved=0CJwBEKAfMA0" target="_blank">Google Maps</a>.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Z Space is easily accessible by BART, MUNI, car, bike, and foot. The neighborhood around Z Space teems with artists studios, galleries, bakeries, chocolate factories, and some of SF's hottest bars and restaurants.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">For all space use requests, please submit an inquiry via our&nbsp;<a href="https://forms.gle/GiePVrw8beh7cNQ16" target="_blank">online form</a>.&nbsp;Note that it may take up to 2 weeks to respond to your rental request and that most rentals need 4-6 months advance notice for consideration. Thank you!</p>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/d9a56a81-364c-4708-9548-c94d020946a7_1250/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/d9a56a81-364c-4708-9548-c94d020946a7_1250/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.button" data-sqsp-block="button" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1541792110054_24882" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1541792110054_24882"><div class="sqs-block-content">



  



<div
  class="sqs-block-button-container  sqs-block-button-container--center "
  data-animation-role="button"
  data-button-size="medium"
  data-button-type="primary"
  
>
  <a
