</div></div><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-border-radii="&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-yui_3_17_2_16_1494262765949_90017"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Formalized in 2018, our Subspace program provides heavily subsidized or free rent and support to artists who cannot afford our below-market non-profit rental rate. Since its inception, Z has given away over $350,000 in subsidies to our community. To learn more and apply for Subspace funds, please visit our Subspace page here.</p><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">OUR SPACES</h2><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">We have three distinct space to rent. Specifications and accommodations of each space can be found below. If you are interested in renting one of the spaces, contact Nikki Meñez at nmenez@zspace.org. &nbsp;</p>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/40c9657b-bc39-4da9-859b-00b79a7aae50_1403/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/40c9657b-bc39-4da9-859b-00b79a7aae50_1403/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.spacer" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1541792110054_58248" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1541792110054_58248"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4"><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type="2" data-border-radii="&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;" data-sqsp-block="text" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1541792110054_70093"><div class="sqs-block-content">

<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>The Steindler Stage</strong></h3><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Flexible performance space</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Professional stage lighting</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Sound system &amp; PA system available</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Stage is 40’ wide by 80’ deep, sprung floor</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Capacity: Performance seating: 229–236. Total building capacity 399</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Front and rear projection screens</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">The Z Lobby space (see right) is included in a rental of the Steindler Stage</p></li></ul>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/d9a56a81-364c-4708-9548-c94d020946a7_1250/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/d9a56a81-364c-4708-9548-c94d020946a7_1250/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.button" data-sqsp-block="button" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1541791582860_20676" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1541791582860_20676"><div class="sqs-block-content">



  



