<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Z LOBBY</strong></h3><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">40’ high ceilings and natural light</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Small prep kitchen available</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Full bar available for all events</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Sound system &amp; PA system and 12' x 8' movable stage available (extra charges apply)</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Capacity: approx 125 people standing</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Room Specs: 40’ wide by 20’ across</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">19' wide by 12' high Gallery wall + small moveable wall for art installations or projections</p></li></ul>
</div>




















  
  



</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/d9a56a81-364c-4708-9548-c94d020946a7_1250/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/d9a56a81-364c-4708-9548-c94d020946a7_1250/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.button" data-sqsp-block="button" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1541791582860_24825" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1541791582860_24825"><div class="sqs-block-content">



  



